        "text": "Tip #9: \u201cMy GUI Is Hung, and I\u2019m Stuck!\u201d\nOne quick solution to this problem is pressing Ctrl + Alt + Backspace. If this doesn\u2019t\ndo the trick, your system is in really bad shape! Try to switch to a virtual terminal\nby using Ctrl + Alt + F5. If this key combination also does nothing, you need to reboot\nthe machine.\nFIGURE 22-3:\nThe Displays\nSettings window\nin Ubuntu.\nCHAPTER 22 Ten Troubleshooting Tips 431",
